"Let :math:`D\\Subset\\mathbb R^2` be a bounded obstacle or penetrable "
"inclusion with boundary :math:`\\Gamma`.  Outside a bounded region the "
"material is homogeneous, with constants :math:`a_0,b_0>0` and exterior "
"wavenumber :math:`k_0=\\omega\\sqrt{b_0/a_0}`."
