"For an obstacle, the unknown total field is defined in the exterior of "
":math:`D`.  For a penetrable inclusion, it is defined across the whole "
"plane; the coefficients may vary inside the compact contrast region.  The "
"circular verification case later specializes the inclusion to constants "
":math:`(a_1,b_1)`."
msgstr ""
"对于障碍物，总场未知量定义在 :math:`D` "
"的外部。对于可穿透夹杂，总场定义在整个平面上，且系数可以在紧支反差区域内变化。后面的圆形验证算例进一步将夹杂内部取为常数 "
":math:`(a_1,b_1)`。"

