#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\int_{\\Omega_L}a\\nabla u\\cdot\\nabla\\overline v\n"
"-\\omega^2\\int_{\\Omega_L}bu\\overline v\n"
"-a_t\\langle T_+u,v\\rangle_{\\Gamma_+}\n"
"-\\delta_{\\rm slab}a_b\\langle T_-u,v\\rangle_{\\Gamma_-}\n"
"=a_t\\langle g_+,v\\rangle_{\\Gamma_+}"
msgstr ""
"\\int_{\\Omega_L}a\\nabla u\\cdot\\nabla\\overline v\n"
"-\\omega^2\\int_{\\Omega_L}bu\\overline v\n"
"-a_t\\langle T_+u,v\\rangle_{\\Gamma_+}\n"
"-\\delta_{\\rm slab}a_b\\langle T_-u,v\\rangle_{\\Gamma_-}\n"
"=a_t\\langle g_+,v\\rangle_{\\Gamma_+}"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:479
#: ad123e977b634a81ae3b3110f23e8e2a
msgid ""
"for every homogeneous test function :math:`v`.  In the present slab "
":math:`a_t=a_b=a_0`.  A Neumann wall is natural and contributes no lower "
"boundary term.  This form fixes the implementation order: assemble the "
"volume and DtN operators, apply ``BlochReducer`` to form :math:`T^HAT` and "
":math:`T^Hb`, then apply ``Condenser`` only for the Dirichlet wall."
msgstr ""
"对任意齐次试验函数 :math:`v` 均成立。当前 slab 中 :math:`a_t=a_b=a_0`。Neumann "
"墙面是自然边界，不产生底部边界项。该弱形式确定实现顺序：先装配体积和 DtN 算子，再用 ``BlochReducer`` 形成 "
":math:`T^HAT` 和 :math:`T^Hb`，最后只对 Dirichlet 墙面应用 ``Condenser``。"

