#: 81c80fb4be7a4c089ee228c1db4c4a86
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The general periodic problem may couple many Rayleigh orders.  For code "
"verification, the flat interfaces preserve the incident order.  With "
":math:`\\beta=\\beta_{0,0}` and :math:`\\gamma=\\beta_{1,0}`, the incident, "
"scattered, and top total fields are"
msgstr ""
"一般周期问题可能耦合多个 Rayleigh 阶。为了验证代码，平界面保持入射模态的阶数不变。令 "
":math:`\\beta=\\beta_{0,0}`、:math:`\\gamma=\\beta_{1,0}`，则入射场、散射场和顶部总场为"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:493
#: 93ef7ebe95a54ff8899f77dc3689f7fe
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"u^{\\rm inc}&=Ae^{i\\alpha x_1-i\\beta(x_2-y_t)},\\\\\n"
"u^{\\rm sc}&=re^{i\\alpha x_1+i\\beta(x_2-y_t)},\\\\\n"
"u_{\\rm top}&=u^{\\rm inc}+u^{\\rm sc}.\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"u^{\\rm inc}&=Ae^{i\\alpha x_1-i\\beta(x_2-y_t)},\\\\\n"
"u^{\\rm sc}&=re^{i\\alpha x_1+i\\beta(x_2-y_t)},\\\\\n"
"u_{\\rm top}&=u^{\\rm inc}+u^{\\rm sc}.\n"
"\\end{aligned}"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:501
#: c2f85bc9042f4c60bb21b5a160ca846a
msgid "The layer and lower transmitted total fields are"
msgstr "介质层内总场和底部透射总场为"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:503
#: 80debdf54659431d92fcb62e2258f3c6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"u_{\\rm layer}&=e^{i\\alpha x_1}\n"
"\\left[pe^{-i\\gamma x_2}+qe^{i\\gamma x_2}\\right],\\\\\n"
"u_{\\rm bottom}&=u^{\\rm tr}\n"
"=te^{i\\alpha x_1-i\\beta(x_2-y_b)}.\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"u_{\\rm layer}&=e^{i\\alpha x_1}\n"
"\\left[pe^{-i\\gamma x_2}+qe^{i\\gamma x_2}\\right],\\\\\n"
"u_{\\rm bottom}&=u^{\\rm tr}\n"
"=te^{i\\alpha x_1-i\\beta(x_2-y_b)}.\n"
"\\end{aligned}"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:512
#: 648bf6c0540a4b74aa23a7be649a50ca
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Continuity of :math:`u` and :math:`a\\partial_{x_2}u` at :math:`x_2=h` and "
":math:`x_2=0` gives the four-by-four system for :math:`(r,p,q,t)` used in "
"the script.  A wall removes the lower port and uses the layer total fields"
msgstr ""
"在 :math:`x_2=h` 和 :math:`x_2=0` 处令 :math:`u` 与 :math:`a\\partial_{x_2}u` "
"连续，可得到脚本中关于 :math:`(r,p,q,t)` 的四阶线性系统。wall 算例移除底部端口，并改用介质层内总场"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:516
#: 7200be92094b4c77b7a7bcdf3517559f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"u_D=d\\,e^{i\\alpha x_1}\\sin(\\gamma x_2),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"u_N=d\\,e^{i\\alpha x_1}\\cos(\\gamma x_2)."
msgstr ""
"u_D=d\\,e^{i\\alpha x_1}\\sin(\\gamma x_2),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"u_N=d\\,e^{i\\alpha x_1}\\cos(\\gamma x_2)."

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:522
#: 826663169d0d4aebabed62a6d3e3da71
msgid ""
"The sine enforces the Dirichlet trace and the cosine has zero normal "
"derivative at :math:`x_2=0`; matching at :math:`h` gives a two-by-two system"
" for :math:`(r,d)`."
msgstr ""
"正弦函数满足 Dirichlet 迹，余弦函数在 :math:`x_2=0` 处法向导数为零；在 :math:`h` 处匹配可得到关于 "
":math:`(r,d)` 的二阶线性系统。"

