#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:600
#: f4e6cf93a5504445b8c3cc7d79938987
msgid "TensorMesh assembly details"
msgstr "TensorMesh 装配细节"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:601
#: 596a602519b045b0b3f9126ed923efe7
msgid "The reading order mirrors the official Helmholtz demo:"
msgstr "阅读顺序与官方 Helmholtz 示例一致："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:603
#: 224ca69cdd4e4d8b9fb24daedc1a1bde
msgid ""
"keep mesh geometry, basis functions, Jacobians, and quadrature in "
"``float64``;"
msgstr "网格几何、基函数、Jacobian 和求积均保持为 ``float64``；"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:604
#: 56967795169d475badb4108dc3d86fc8
msgid ""
"promote ``HelmholtzAssembler`` to ``complex128`` and assemble "
":math:`a\\nabla u\\cdot\\nabla v-\\omega^2buv` with ``ElementAssembler``;"
msgstr ""
"将 ``HelmholtzAssembler`` 提升为 ``complex128``，并用 ``ElementAssembler`` 装配 "
":math:`a\\nabla u\\cdot\\nabla v-\\omega^2buv`；"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:606
#: f323ebb31bd5411796a29b0861ecd64a
msgid "compute modal traces with ``FacetAssembler``;"
msgstr "用 ``FacetAssembler`` 计算模态迹；"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:607
#: afeefcf9793044078ee8b917aec73b4a
msgid "add the nonlocal DtN block to the TensorMesh sparse COO matrix;"
msgstr "将非局部 DtN 块加入 TensorMesh 稀疏 COO 矩阵；"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:608
#: 7da5bca64c944d30a58312cb2e266fd2
msgid ""
"impose constraints, solve the general complex system, and compare with the "
"exact field."
msgstr "施加约束，求解一般复数系统，并与真解比较。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:611
#: 793214739c734f00be614e19b6ba61c9
msgid ""
"The weighted volume form is the only problem-specific element assembler.  "
"All basis evaluation, quadrature, Jacobian transformations, element "
"indexing, and global sparse scatter remain inside TensorMesh:"
msgstr "加权体积变分形式是唯一针对本问题定义的单元装配器。基函数计算、数值求积、Jacobian 变换、单元索引和全局稀疏散布均由 TensorMesh 完成："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:615
#: 5dfd4ccb66214de197dc7b3a96400797
msgid "Weighted complex Helmholtz assembly (shared pattern)"
msgstr "加权复 Helmholtz 装配（共享模式）"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:633
#: f1aa81822901466db0da9c0cccc07e8d
msgid ""
"TensorMesh 0.2.0 also provides ``FacetBilinearAssembler`` for local Robin or"
" impedance matrices.  A DtN map is nonlocal, however, so these demos "
"intentionally use ``FacetAssembler`` for modal moments and form the low-rank"
" boundary block only after integration."
msgstr ""
"TensorMesh 0.2.0 还提供 ``FacetBilinearAssembler`` 来装配局部 Robin 或阻抗矩阵。但 DtN "
"映射是非局部的，因此这些示例有意使用 ``FacetAssembler`` 计算模态矩，并在积分完成后再形成低秩边界块。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:638
#: 8f4a34aa7ae24321aa8e7da835ed5b32
msgid ""
"The facet path is real, so each exponential is integrated as cosine and "
"negative-sine channels, then combined as ``complex128``.  If :math:`\\Psi` "
"is the modal moment matrix, both demos use"
msgstr ""
"面装配路径为实数，因此每个指数模态先按余弦和负正弦两个通道积分，再组合为 ``complex128``。若 :math:`\\Psi` "
"为模态矩矩阵，则两个示例都使用"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:646
#: 24574c200a614f53ab3a758ea4dcad78
msgid ""
"The last factor is a plain transpose because :math:`\\Psi^Tu` gives modal "
"coefficients.  The matrix is not assumed Hermitian or positive definite.  "
"The scripts call TensorMesh ``SparseMatrix.solve`` with the SciPy LU backend"
" selected explicitly instead of requesting an SPD solver."
msgstr ""
"最后一个因子采用普通转置，因为 :math:`\\Psi^Tu` 给出模态系数。这里不假设矩阵为 Hermitian 或正定。脚本调用 "
"TensorMesh 的 ``SparseMatrix.solve``，并显式选择 SciPy LU 后端，而不是请求 SPD 求解器。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:651
#: 3fd684370578473e94c65bdca19e413f
msgid "For a periodic Dirichlet wall, the operation order is essential:"
msgstr "对于带周期 Dirichlet 壁面的算例，操作顺序至关重要："

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:653
#: c59e8012193d484ba1d5bdc8181db363
msgid "assemble the full volume and DtN matrix;"
msgstr "装配完整的体积矩阵和 DtN 矩阵；"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:654
#: 22ca4cc47adc444da65f9af3bf8e1bc0
msgid "form :math:`T^HAT` and :math:`T^Hb` with ``BlochReducer(sign=+1)``;"
msgstr "使用 ``BlochReducer(sign=+1)`` 形成 :math:`T^HAT` 和 :math:`T^Hb`；"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:655
#: 8b020bd6758a4aae993912cf54269df7
msgid "map the complete bottom trace to unique Bloch master degrees of freedom;"
msgstr "将完整底部迹映射到唯一的 Bloch 主自由度；"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:656
#: af6a99d3382242e0b9702d845f378263
msgid "apply ``Condenser`` and solve;"
msgstr "应用 ``Condenser`` 并求解；"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:657
#: c3de9f8df697405693abd792e6dc74ae
msgid "recover through ``Condenser`` and then ``BlochReducer``."
msgstr "先通过 ``Condenser`` 恢复，再通过 ``BlochReducer`` 恢复。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:659
#: 207a06a16cb243668330cc188c906207
msgid ""
"The Neumann wall is a natural weak boundary and skips condensation.  The "
"tests compare the Bloch reductions with an explicit matrix :math:`T`, "
"substitute orders :math:`-2,0,3` into the circular boundary conditions, "
"check P1 convergence, and verify amplitudes, powers, Bloch traces, and "
"nonzero-mode leakage."
msgstr ""
"Neumann 壁面是自然弱边界，因此跳过凝聚。测试将 Bloch 缩减与显式矩阵 :math:`T` 比较，把阶数 :math:`-2,0,3` "
"代回圆形边界条件，检验 P1 收敛性，并验证振幅、功率、Bloch 迹和非零模态泄漏。"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:666
#: 66f4598cd96a4c128440f377107b6b92
