msgstr "绘图与解析验证"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:667
#: a9b5bd4b49e34aeaa87709a40b8ba0ae
msgid ""
"Both scripts use :meth:`~tensormesh.Mesh.plot` rather than constructing an "
