#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:670
#: e46e49bbcff144aebbc73e7d268161ba
msgid "Numerical field, exact field, and pointwise error"
msgstr "数值场、真解场与逐点误差"

#: ../../source/example_gallery/helmholtz_dtn.rst:682
#: d4e76f3dd5184b8dabdba2899230a217
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"With the default CPU ``complex128`` settings, the three circular cases have "
"relative nodal errors below :math:`5.6\\times10^{-2}` and fitted P1 "
"convergence orders between :math:`1.71` and :math:`1.74`.  For the periodic "
"cases, the relative errors in the analytical amplitudes remain below "
":math:`2.0\\times10^{-2}`, the energy-balance residual is below "
":math:`2.0\\times10^{-15}`, and the recovered Bloch trace agrees to machine "
"precision.  The committed figures show the numerical field, analytical "
"field, and their pointwise error for every case."
msgstr ""
"在默认 CPU ``complex128`` 设置下，三个圆形算例的相对节点误差均小于 :math:`5.6\\times10^{-2}`，拟合得到的 "
"P1 收敛阶位于 :math:`1.71` 到 :math:`1.74` 之间。对于周期算例，解析振幅的相对误差小于 "
":math:`2.0\\times10^{-2}`，能量平衡残差小于 :math:`2.0\\times10^{-15}`，恢复后的 Bloch "
"迹在机器精度范围内一致。提交的图片展示了每个算例的数值场、解析场及其逐点误差。"
